    "Mixed timing: 12/18 warm cases improved, six regressed; archive import unfiltered median113.358\u2192122.993ms (+8.5%). Metadata regressed10.9\u201313.7%. This is not an overall broad-query win.",
    "Raw posting bytes increased93,864,306\u2192133,139,976 (+41.84%). Archive-import cache increased746,141\u21921,293,003B (+73.29%) while retaining the16MiB cap.",
    "Extrapolating the observed cache ratio onto the previous2M14.89MB broad-query working set gives about25.8MB; this is an inference, not an actual2M candidate measurement. Eviction and extra SQL/decryption may erase CPU savings.",
    "All accepted query physical read_bytes counters were0. This experiment primarily measures warm CPU/SQLite behavior and does not establish cold-device latency.",
    "No claim of achieving the500ms full2M target. No packed/RLE prefix variant implemented. No production migration implemented.",
    "Initial private build attempts used a stale3.11 package config missing sodium and attempted blocked advisory/native-asset resolution. Final builds use matching3.12 package config+package_graph, private depfiles and identical native libraries."
